        "subject": "LU-20872 build: Don't build kernel modules for dkms-debs",
        "message": "LU-20872 build: Don't build kernel modules for dkms-debs\n\nDKMS builds the kernel modules on the target, so skip them when\npackaging dkms-debs and drop the int_o2ib profile.  Also generate\nthe missing lustre-tests.install for dkms-debs, without test\nmodules.\n\nTest-Parameters: trivial testgroup=full-dkms\nSigned-off-by: Xiao Yang <xyang@ddn.com>\nChange-Id: Ic9875ae57b88c944f6469e12d7d4f610d6d9c649\n"
